                            {
                                "example_id": "d75db001-30d3-4c21-b6cb-489cdf75b17e",
                                "sense_id": "0b4b2c74-0dcf-3ddf-bf4c-295439a163f6",
                                "text": "Все мы наи́вные материали́сты, ду́мал я. И все мы рационали́сты. Мы хоти́м, что́бы всё бы́ло неме́дленно объяснено́ рационалисти́чески, то есть сведено́ к го́рсточке уже́ изве́стных фа́ктов.",
                                "translation": "We are all naïve materialists, I thought, and also rationalists. We demand that everything should be explained immediately in rationalist terms; that is, reduced to fit in with the handful of known facts.",
                                "english": "We are all naïve materialists, I thought, and also rationalists. We demand that everything should be explained immediately in rationalist terms; that is, reduced to fit in with the handful of known facts."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
